  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PPL ICT Strategy Roadmap, through Enterprise - United States Unknown</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds technical assistance for PNG Power Limited (PPL), a state-owned electric utility in Papua New Guinea, to develop a roadmap for a fully integrated information and communications technology (ICT) platform. This roadmap would develop specifications and an implementation plan for deploying a smart metering system, communications network components and all major sub-systems comprising its ICT infrastructure, which is expected to lead to improved quality of service.</narrative>
  </description>
